WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.786
Guimbi Ouattara. O ye tarikiko dɔ lo ye.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.298
Saan kɛmɛkulu 19nan laban na. Sya, an b'a wele bi ko Bobo-Dioulasso.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.410
Muso kelen lo be yen ka tɛmɛ cɛɛ caaman kan: Guimbi Ouattara.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.272
Aw ka kan k'a taran ɲɔgɔn na, mɔgɔ kelen kelen bɛɛ ye a ta yɔrɔ sɔrɔ.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:51.472
An b'an janto a la walisa ka bɛnbaliyakow ɲɛnabɔ ani k'a lamɛn.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:08.032
Loon dɔ, Erɔpikaw tun be taga Ɛsi jamana na.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:16.520
A y'a fɔ a ye ko a ka na n'a ye jii ni kola ye.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:22.112
N b'a fɛ k'aw fo kosɔbɛ.

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:25.288
O yɔrɔ la, n' be lonanw tanga.

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:28.580
Ne ye min ye, n bena o sɛbɛ.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:49.418
Nka, faratiba dɔ b'an kan. Sikasɔ masacɛ Teba tun b'a fɛ ka dɔ fara a ta fanga kan.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:55.546
Bobo bena sɔn. A fɔ a ye n' ka kuma na.

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:02.904
Mɔgɔ dɔ b'a fɛ k'o kɛ.

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:20.564
Tiba b'a fɛ i k'i yɛrɛ majigi.

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:24.200
Guimbi be wili.

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:30.532
I k'a fɔ i kuntigi ye ko Bobo tɛ sɔn ka biri.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:40.434
Mɔgɔ si kana kuma kɛnɛma. Mɔgɔ bɛɛ b'a lɔn ko n'u banna, o kɔrɔ ye min ye.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:03:00.010
Sotigiw tagara se dugu kɔrɔ. K'u to kogow kan, u ka lafasabagaw b'u yɛrɛ tanga.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:12.842
Sanbɛrɛw be ben. O kama, mɔgɔ tɛ se k'a yɛrɛ minɛ.

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:22.576
A laban, sotigiw be tagara kɔfɛ.

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:42.376
Bobo kisira ani dugumɔgɔw ye Guimbi tando.

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:14.174
Guimbi! Ale min y'a yɛrɛ di masacɛ dɔ ma.

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:20.000
Bobo-Dioulasso dugu la, mɔgɔw bele b'a tɔgɔ lɔn.
